1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videomiz nim haqida? Sartaroshxona yoki sartaroshxonadagi suhbatlar haqida. Gapirish xavfli bo'lishi mumkin, bilasizmi?

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:13,008
1-Sahna: Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish asoslari

3
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:15,674
Xush kelibsiz!

4
00:00:15,697 --> 00:00:19,330
Oldindan buyurtma bergan mijozmisiz?

5
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:23,687
Ha, soat oʻn uchun buyurtma bergan edim.

6
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:26,343
Yamada.

7
00:00:26,366 --> 00:00:29,033
Yamada mijozimiz, shundaymi?

8
00:00:29,056 --> 00:00:32,325
Sizni kutayotgan edik.

9
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:34,983
Iltimos, menga yordam bering.

10
00:00:35,007 --> 00:00:38,907
Yuklaringizni saqlab qoʻyaylik.

11
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:42,087
Ha, iltimos.

12
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,745
Bu sumka.

13
00:00:44,769 --> 00:00:48,736
Ustki kiyimingizni ham saqlab qoʻyamizmi?

14
00:00:48,759 --> 00:00:52,638
Ha, iltimos.

15
00:00:52,661 --> 00:00:55,765
Bu tomonga boring.

16
00:00:55,788 --> 00:00:58,545
Joyingizga olib boraman.

17
00:00:58,569 --> 00:01:01,207
Rahmat.

18
00:01:01,230 --> 00:01:04,897
Bugun ob-havo yaxshi, shundaymi?

19
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,858
Ha, shunday.

20
00:01:07,881 --> 00:01:11,715
Biroz issiq, lekin.

21
00:01:11,737 --> 00:01:15,571
Ha, tashqarida issiq.

22
00:01:15,594 --> 00:01:19,627
Doʻkonda salqin.

23
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:22,150
Yaxshi boʻldi.

24
00:01:22,173 --> 00:01:25,673
Nima ichishni xohlaysiz?

25
00:01:25,696 --> 00:01:29,037
Suv bering, iltimos.

26
00:01:29,061 --> 00:01:31,928
Tushunarli.

27
00:01:31,951 --> 00:01:35,817
Sovuq suv olib kelaman.

28
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:38,474
Rahmat.

29
00:01:38,497 --> 00:01:41,063
Yordam berasiz.

30
00:01:41,086 --> 00:01:45,228
Tez orada mas’ul xodim keladi.

31
00:01:45,252 --> 00:01:48,752
Ha, kutaman.

32
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,710
Iltimos, biroz kutib turing.

33
00:01:51,733 --> 00:01:54,600
Tushunarli.

34
00:01:54,623 --> 00:02:01,728
Bugungi videodagi materiallarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yaxshi sharhda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

35
00:02:01,728 --> 00:02:04,728
2-Sahna: Kutish vaqtini tekshirish

36
00:02:04,728 --> 00:02:08,028
Xush kelibsiz!

37
00:02:08,051 --> 00:02:10,751
Uzr, men...

38
00:02:10,774 --> 00:02:16,130
Oldindan buyurtma bermagan edim, lekin muammo boʻlmaydi, shundaymi?

39
00:02:16,153 --> 00:02:20,526
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

40
00:02:20,550 --> 00:02:24,716
Hozir bandmisiz?

41
00:02:24,739 --> 00:02:27,673
Ha, shunday.

42
00:02:27,697 --> 00:02:32,364
Oldinda ikki nafar mijoz bor.

43
00:02:32,387 --> 00:02:36,464
Qancha kutish kerak boʻladi?

44
00:02:36,488 --> 00:02:40,397
Taxminan 30 daqiqa.

45
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:43,171
Tushunarli.

46
00:02:43,195 --> 00:02:45,361
Kutaman.

47
00:02:45,384 --> 00:02:50,418
Iltimos, u yerda oʻtirib kutib turing.

48
00:02:50,441 --> 00:02:56,074
Ha, jurnal oʻqishim mumkinmi?

49
00:02:56,097 --> 00:02:59,130
Albatta.

50
00:02:59,153 --> 00:03:01,420
Marhamat.

51
00:03:01,443 --> 00:03:04,309
Rahmat.

52
00:03:04,332 --> 00:03:09,847
Bu mavsumda koʻp yomgʻir yogʻadi, shundaymi?

53
00:03:09,871 --> 00:03:14,337
Ha, koʻp yogʻadi.

54
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:17,929
Soyaboningiz bormi?

55
00:03:17,952 --> 00:03:21,622
Ha, bor.

56
00:03:21,646 --> 00:03:25,821
Soyabon eshik yonida.

57
00:03:25,844 --> 00:03:29,678
A, shu yerga qo'yaman.

58
00:03:29,701 --> 00:03:32,697
Kutib turgandingiz, uzr.

59
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:36,359
Keyingisi, iltimos.

60
00:03:36,383 --> 00:03:39,549
Ha, menman.

61
00:03:39,572 --> 00:03:43,521
Bu stulga o'tiring, iltimos.

62
00:03:43,544 --> 00:03:47,111
Iltimos, menga yordam bering.

63
00:03:47,134 --> 00:03:57,142
Eshitsangiz, izoh qoldiring.

64
00:03:57,142 --> 00:04:00,142
3-SAHNA: Soch turmushini va rangini o'zgartirish / Sochingizni qanday qilib o'zgartirish va rang berish

65
00:04:00,142 --> 00:04:05,009
Bugun qanday soch turmushini xohlaysiz?

66
00:04:05,032 --> 00:04:09,965
Biroz qisqartirmoqchiman.

67
00:04:09,988 --> 00:04:13,488
Qancha qisqartirish kerak?

68
00:04:13,511 --> 00:04:18,883
Umuman 3 santimetrga qisqartiring.

69
00:04:18,907 --> 00:04:21,479
Tushunarli.

70
00:04:21,503 --> 00:04:25,437
Peshona sochlari bilan nima qilamiz?

71
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:31,360
Peshona sochlari ko'zlarimning ustida bo'lsin.

72
00:04:31,383 --> 00:04:33,928
Tushunarli.

73
00:04:33,951 --> 00:04:37,950
Soch rangini ham o'zgartiramizmi?

74
00:04:37,974 --> 00:04:43,333
Ha, biroz yorqinroq rangga o'tkazmoqchiman.

75
00:04:43,356 --> 00:04:47,189
Bu rasmda ko'rsatilgan rang qanday?

76
00:04:47,212 --> 00:04:49,916
Yaxshi ko'rinadi.

77
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:53,514
Shu rangda qilib qo'ying.

78
00:04:53,538 --> 00:04:56,857
Jingalak ham qilamizmi?

79
00:04:56,880 --> 00:05:01,113
Yo'q, jingalak qilmaslik kerak.

80
00:05:01,136 --> 00:05:03,670
Tushunarli.

81
00:05:03,692 --> 00:05:07,192
Soch kesish va rang berish.

82
00:05:07,216 --> 00:05:09,449
Ha.

83
00:05:09,472 --> 00:05:12,550
Bu qancha turadi?

84
00:05:12,574 --> 00:05:16,974
Jami 8000 yen bo'ladi.

85
00:05:16,997 --> 00:05:21,264
Qancha vaqt ketadi?

86
00:05:21,287 --> 00:05:24,953
2 soat atrofida ketadi.

87
00:05:24,976 --> 00:05:27,476
Tushunarli.

88
00:05:27,499 --> 00:05:29,809
Muammo yo'q.

89
00:05:29,833 --> 00:05:33,009
Endi boshlaymiz.

90
00:05:33,033 --> 00:05:35,982
Iltimos, menga yordam bering.

91
00:05:36,005 --> 00:05:41,705
Agar biror narsa noqulay bo'lsa, aytib qo'ying.

92
00:05:41,728 --> 00:05:45,231
Ha, tushunarli.

93
00:05:45,254 --> 00:05:48,254
4-SAHNA: Soch olish buyurtmalari / Soch kesish bo'yicha ko'rsatmalar

94
00:05:48,254 --> 00:05:52,087
Bugun nima qilamiz?

95
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:55,810
Har doimdagidek qilib qo'ying.

96
00:05:55,833 --> 00:06:00,733
Yon tomonlar va orqani qisqartiramiz.

97
00:06:00,757 --> 00:06:05,790
Ha, mashinkadan foydalaning.

98
00:06:05,813 --> 00:06:10,154
Mashinkani qancha millimetrda ishlataylik?

99
00:06:10,177 --> 00:06:14,557
6 millimetrda qisqartiring.

100
00:06:14,580 --> 00:06:18,847
Yuqori qismdagi sochlarni uzunroq qoldiramizmi?

101
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:24,207
Yo'q, yuqorini ham biroz qisqartiring.

102
00:06:24,231 --> 00:06:27,097
Tushunarli.

103
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,877
Chakkalarga nima qilamiz?

104
00:06:30,901 --> 00:06:34,735
Oddiy uzunlikda qilib qo'ying.

105
00:06:34,758 --> 00:06:37,991
Tushunarli.

106
00:06:38,014 --> 00:06:42,781
Quloq atrofini ham tozalaymizmi?

107
00:06:42,804 --> 00:06:48,870
Ha, quloqqa soch tushmasligi uchun tozalang.

108
00:06:48,893 --> 00:06:52,685
Bo'yinning pastki qismini qanday shakllantiramiz?

109
00:06:52,709 --> 00:06:56,613
Tabiiy ko'rinishda qilib qo'ying.

110
00:06:56,636 --> 00:06:59,307
Tushunarli.

111
00:06:59,330 --> 00:07:02,597
Yuzni ham tozalaymizmi?

112
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:08,053
Ha, yuz tozalashni ham yoqtiraman, iltimos.

113
00:07:08,076 --> 00:07:12,111
Qoshlardan ham biroz tozalaymizmi?

114
00:07:12,134 --> 00:07:17,077
Ha, biroz ingichka qilib qo'ying.

115
00:07:17,101 --> 00:07:19,801
Tushunarli.

116
00:07:19,824 --> 00:07:22,973
Endi kesishni boshlaymiz.

117
00:07:22,997 --> 00:07:26,830
Iltimos, menga yordam bering.

118
00:07:26,853 --> 00:07:31,286
Agar ogʻrisa, darhol aytib qoʻying.

119
00:07:31,309 --> 00:07:35,178
Ha, tushunarli.

120
00:07:35,202 --> 00:07:38,202
5-Sahna: Goʻzallik salonida shamollatish / Salonlarda Soch Yuvish

121
00:07:38,202 --> 00:07:42,502
Shampun stoli tomon sizni kuzatib boramiz.

122
00:07:42,525 --> 00:07:45,002
Ha.

123
00:07:45,025 --> 00:07:48,925
Iltimos, bu stulga oʻtiring.

124
00:07:48,948 --> 00:07:52,505
Ha, oʻtiraman.

125
00:07:52,529 --> 00:07:56,196
Stulni egamiz.

126
00:07:56,219 --> 00:07:58,919
Tushunarli.

127
00:07:58,942 --> 00:08:02,442
Boʻyin ogʻrimayapti, shundaymi?

128
00:08:02,465 --> 00:08:06,098
Ha, yaxshi.

129
00:08:06,121 --> 00:08:09,754
Suv harorati qanday?

130
00:08:09,777 --> 00:08:12,856
Aynan mos keladi.

131
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:17,813
Suv juda issiq yoki sovuq emasmi?

132
00:08:17,836 --> 00:08:21,569
Hech qanday muammo yoʻq.

133
00:08:21,593 --> 00:08:25,426
Endi yuvamiz.

134
00:08:25,449 --> 00:08:27,882
Iltimos.

135
00:08:27,905 --> 00:08:32,057
Bosim kuchini qanday his qilayapsiz?

136
00:08:32,081 --> 00:08:36,435
Biroz kuchliroq boʻlishi mumkin.

137
00:08:36,458 --> 00:08:40,425
Shunday qilib, bu holatda qanday?

138
00:08:40,448 --> 00:08:44,915
Ah, juda yoqimli!

139
00:08:44,938 --> 00:08:48,639
Qichima joy bormi?

140
00:08:48,662 --> 00:08:51,581
Muammo yo'q.

141
00:08:51,605 --> 00:08:55,146
Endi yuvamiz.

142
00:08:55,169 --> 00:08:57,035
Ha.

143
00:08:57,058 --> 00:08:59,976
Rahmat, charchadingiz.

144
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,136
Stulga qaytamiz.

145
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:06,593
Katta rahmat.

146
00:09:06,616 --> 00:09:09,616
6-Sahna: Band kunlar va dam olish uchun onsen sayohati / Band Kunlar va Dam Olish Onsen Sayohati

147
00:09:09,616 --> 00:09:14,649
Yaqinda ishlaringiz bandmi?

148
00:09:14,672 --> 00:09:16,811
Ha.

149
00:09:16,835 --> 00:09:21,402
Har kuni qoʻshimcha ishlayapman.

150
00:09:21,425 --> 00:09:24,812
Bu juda qiyin boʻlsa kerak.

151
00:09:24,836 --> 00:09:28,503
Dam olish kunlaringiz bormi?

152
00:09:28,526 --> 00:09:35,433
Dam olish kunlari dam olaman, lekin charchaganimdan uxlab yotaman.

153
00:09:35,456 --> 00:09:40,589
Vaqt-vaqti bilan dam olishingiz kerak.

154
00:09:40,612 --> 00:09:42,920
Ha, shunday.

155
00:09:42,944 --> 00:09:46,914
Qayergadir borishni xohlayman.

156
00:09:46,937 --> 00:09:50,576
Onsen (issiq buloq) qanday?

157
00:09:50,599 --> 00:09:53,333
Yaxshi ko'rinadi.

158
00:09:53,356 --> 00:09:58,189
Onsenga borib, tinchlanmoqchiman.

159
00:09:58,212 --> 00:10:04,118
Yaqin atrofda yangi onsen ochilgan ekan.

160
00:10:04,142 --> 00:10:06,375
Rostdanmi?

161
00:10:06,398 --> 00:10:09,316
Bilmadim.

162
00:10:09,339 --> 00:10:14,607
Ha, juda chiroyli va keng ekan.

163
00:10:14,631 --> 00:10:19,185
Kelgusi dam olish kunida borib koʻrayinmi.

164
00:10:19,209 --> 00:10:22,709
Albatta borib koʻring.

165
00:10:22,731 --> 00:10:28,604
Aytib oʻtishim kerak, bu doʻkon necha yil davomida ishlayapti?

166
00:10:28,628 --> 00:10:32,528
Yigirma yil boʻldi.

167
00:10:32,551 --> 00:10:35,489
Ajoyib!

168
00:10:35,512 --> 00:10:38,250
Uzoq vaqt ekan.

169
00:10:38,274 --> 00:10:43,818
Sizning koʻmagingiz bilan koʻp doimiy mijozlarimiz bor.

170
00:10:43,841 --> 00:10:49,107
Menga bu doʻkonning muhiti juda yoqadi.

171
00:10:49,130 --> 00:10:51,604
Rahmat.

172
00:10:51,628 --> 00:10:55,062
Bu menga juda yoqdi.

173
00:10:55,085 --> 00:10:58,318
Kelajakda ham kelaveraman.

174
00:10:58,341 --> 00:11:01,315
Sizni kutib qolamiz.

175
00:11:01,339 --> 00:11:04,605
Iltimos, menga yordam bering.

176
00:11:04,628 --> 00:11:07,628
7-Sahna: Dori surtilganda vaqtni oʻtkazish usullari / Dori Surtilganda Vaqtni Qanday Oʻtkazish

177
00:11:07,628 --> 00:11:13,662
Endi rangli dori surtamiz.

178
00:11:13,685 --> 00:11:17,318
Ha, iltimos.

179
00:11:17,341 --> 00:11:21,608
Bosh terisiga tushmayapti, shundaymi?

180
00:11:21,631 --> 00:11:26,331
Hozircha yaxshi.

181
00:11:26,354 --> 00:11:31,632
Agar ogʻrisa, darhol aytib qoʻying.

182
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:35,171
Ha, tushunarli.

183
00:11:35,195 --> 00:11:40,152
Jurnal yoki planshet oʻqimoqchimisiz?

184
00:11:40,175 --> 00:11:44,209
Planshetni berib yuborasizmi?

185
00:11:44,232 --> 00:11:47,365
Mana.

186
00:11:47,388 --> 00:11:50,721
Video ham koʻrishingiz mumkin.

187
00:11:50,744 --> 00:11:54,011
Rahmat.

188
00:11:54,034 --> 00:11:57,586
Film koʻraman.

189
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:01,676
Qahva yoki choy ichasizmi?

190
00:12:01,699 --> 00:12:06,893
Unda, muzli qahva bering iltimos.

191
00:12:06,917 --> 00:12:11,250
Sut va shakar qoʻshaymi?

192
00:12:11,273 --> 00:12:15,173
Faqat sut qoʻshib bering.

193
00:12:15,196 --> 00:12:18,229
Tushunarli.

194
00:12:18,252 --> 00:12:21,352
Kutib turgandingiz, uzr.

195
00:12:21,375 --> 00:12:24,609
Mana, muzli qahva.

196
00:12:24,632 --> 00:12:27,498
Rahmat.

197
00:12:27,521 --> 00:12:30,155
Yeyapman.

198
00:12:30,178 --> 00:12:36,411
Dori ranglanishi uchun yigirmacha daqiqa kutamiz.

199
00:12:36,434 --> 00:12:41,209
Ha, dam olayapman.

200
00:12:41,232 --> 00:12:43,932
Sovuq emasmi?

201
00:12:43,955 --> 00:12:48,748
Adyol (adras) ishlatmoqchimisiz?

202
00:12:48,771 --> 00:12:51,742
Muammo yo'q.

203
00:12:51,766 --> 00:12:54,599
Sovuq emas.

204
00:12:54,622 --> 00:12:59,603
Agar biror narsa kerak boʻlsa, ovoz bering.

205
00:12:59,627 --> 00:13:03,606
Ha, rahmat.

206
00:13:03,629 --> 00:13:06,629
Sahna 8: Yuzni qirqish tartibi / Yuzni qirqishning asosiy bosqichlari

207
00:13:06,629 --> 00:13:12,096
Endi yuzingizni qirqamiz.

208
00:13:12,119 --> 00:13:15,152
Stulni egamiz.

209
00:13:15,175 --> 00:13:18,509
Ha, iltimos.

210
00:13:18,532 --> 00:13:23,765
Issiq sochiqni yuzingizga qoʻyamiz.

211
00:13:23,788 --> 00:13:28,130
Oo, juda yoqimli.

212
00:13:28,153 --> 00:13:31,490
Juda issiq emasmi?

213
00:13:31,513 --> 00:13:36,111
Yoʻq, aynan mos harorat.

214
00:13:36,135 --> 00:13:40,534
Endi soqol kremini surtamiz.

215
00:13:40,558 --> 00:13:45,430
Teriningiz ahvoli qanday?

216
00:13:45,453 --> 00:13:48,645
Quruqlashmaganmi?

217
00:13:48,669 --> 00:13:53,606
Biroz quruqlashgan boʻlishi mumkin.

218
00:13:53,629 --> 00:13:59,096
Unda, sekinroq qirqamiz.

219
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,713
Rahmat.

220
00:14:01,736 --> 00:14:05,869
Ogʻriydigan joy bormi?

221
00:14:05,892 --> 00:14:08,426
Muammo yo'q.

222
00:14:08,449 --> 00:14:11,834
Juda yaxshi qilasiz-ku!

223
00:14:11,857 --> 00:14:15,090
Rahmat.

224
00:14:15,113 --> 00:14:19,068
Har kuni shugʻullanaman-ku.

225
00:14:19,092 --> 00:14:21,792
Albatta, shunday.

226
00:14:21,815 --> 00:14:24,515
Professional ekansiz.

227
00:14:24,538 --> 00:14:28,497
Iyak ostini ham qirqamiz.

228
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:32,255
Biroz yuqoriga qarang.

229
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:36,446
Mana, shundaymi?

230
00:14:36,469 --> 00:14:40,102
Ha, yaxshi.

231
00:14:40,125 --> 00:14:43,392
Tugashiga oz qoldi.

232
00:14:43,415 --> 00:14:48,348
Biroz uxlab qolishim keldi.

233
00:14:48,371 --> 00:14:51,604
Dam oling.

234
00:14:51,627 --> 00:14:53,961
Ha.

235
00:14:53,984 --> 00:14:56,984
Sahna 9: SALONDA SOCH USLUBINI SHAKLLANTIRISH / Salonda soch turmaklash

236
00:14:56,984 --> 00:15:01,022
Endi sochingizni quritamiz.

237
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:04,112
Ha, iltimos.

238
00:15:04,135 --> 00:15:08,091
Rangi juda yaxshi chiqdi-ku!

239
00:15:08,114 --> 00:15:11,056
Rostdan ham.

240
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:14,352
Juda yoqdi menga.

241
00:15:14,375 --> 00:15:18,150
Endi stil beraman.

242
00:15:18,173 --> 00:15:21,806
Vaksin solaymi?

243
00:15:21,829 --> 00:15:26,096
Ha, ozgina soling.

244
00:15:26,119 --> 00:15:30,752
Odatda o‘zingiz sochni taraysizmi?

245
00:15:30,775 --> 00:15:36,342
Ha, men uncha yaxshi qilmayman.

246
00:15:36,366 --> 00:15:41,000
Bu vaks juda qulay.

247
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:44,489
Qanday ishlatish kerak?

248
00:15:44,512 --> 00:15:50,903
Qo‘lingizga ozgina olib, sochga yaxshilab surtasiz.

249
00:15:50,927 --> 00:15:55,098
Tushunarli. Oddiydek ko‘rinadi.

250
00:15:55,122 --> 00:16:00,188
Peshona sochlarini oxirida ozgina qo‘shasiz.

251
00:16:00,211 --> 00:16:03,002
Tushunarli.

252
00:16:03,026 --> 00:16:06,393
Ertadan boshlab sinab ko‘raman.

253
00:16:06,416 --> 00:16:11,887
Soch yog‘i ham ishlatsangiz, sochingiz yanada chiroyli bo‘ladi.

254
00:16:11,911 --> 00:16:15,064
Shundaymi?

255
00:16:15,087 --> 00:16:18,621
Qanday yog‘ yaxshi?

256
00:16:18,644 --> 00:16:23,746
Do‘konda sotiladiganlarini tavsiya qilaman.

257
00:16:23,769 --> 00:16:27,545
Unda, men ham bitta sotib olaman.

258
00:16:27,568 --> 00:16:30,342
Rahmat.

259
00:16:30,366 --> 00:16:35,119
Endi orqangizni oynada ko‘rib chiqing.

260
00:16:35,142 --> 00:16:37,928
Yaxshi ko'rinadi.

261
00:16:37,952 --> 00:16:40,660
Ajoyib!

262
00:16:40,683 --> 00:16:43,550
Yaxshi boʻldi.

263
00:16:43,573 --> 00:16:46,206
Rahmat, charchadingiz.

264
00:16:46,229 --> 00:16:49,962
Katta rahmat.

265
00:16:49,985 --> 00:16:52,985
10-sahna: Sartaroshxonada soch olish va massaj / Go‘zallik saloni: Soch olish va massaj

266
00:16:52,985 --> 00:16:56,219
Soch olish tugadi.

267
00:16:56,242 --> 00:16:59,579
Orqangizni qanday his qilayapsiz?

268
00:16:59,602 --> 00:17:03,584
Oynada ko‘rsatib bering.

269
00:17:03,608 --> 00:17:07,204
Ha, iltimos.

270
00:17:07,227 --> 00:17:09,927
Mana, shunday.

271
00:17:09,950 --> 00:17:13,183
Juda toza bo‘ldi.

272
00:17:13,206 --> 00:17:16,939
Aynan kerakli uzunlikda.

273
00:17:16,962 --> 00:17:19,944
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

274
00:17:19,968 --> 00:17:23,534
Endi yelkangizni massaj qilaman.

275
00:17:23,557 --> 00:17:26,424
Iltimos.

276
00:17:26,447 --> 00:17:30,204
A, mana shu joy.

277
00:17:30,228 --> 00:17:33,328
Juda yoqimli.

278
00:17:33,351 --> 00:17:37,741
Yelkangiz biroz qotib qolgan.

279
00:17:37,764 --> 00:17:44,064
Ha, yaqinda ko‘proq kompyuterda ishlayapman.

280
00:17:44,087 --> 00:17:47,038
Charchadingiz ko‘rinib turibdi.

281
00:17:47,062 --> 00:17:51,295
Yaxshilab dam oling.

282
00:17:51,318 --> 00:17:55,152
Ha, rahmat.

283
00:17:55,175 --> 00:17:59,369
Endi hisob-kitob qilamiz.

284
00:17:59,392 --> 00:18:02,359
Kassaga boring.

285
00:18:02,382 --> 00:18:05,882
Ha. Necha pul?

286
00:18:05,905 --> 00:18:12,300
Soch olish va soqol olish uchun 4500 yen.

287
00:18:12,323 --> 00:18:16,590
Kredit karta bilan to‘lash mumkinmi?

288
00:18:16,613 --> 00:18:20,946
Ha, karta ham ishlatishingiz mumkin.

289
00:18:20,969 --> 00:18:26,003
Unda, karta bilan to‘layman.

290
00:18:26,026 --> 00:18:28,665
Ma‘lum bo‘ldi.

291
00:18:28,688 --> 00:18:33,054
Bu yerda PIN-kodingizni kiriting.

292
00:18:33,077 --> 00:18:35,911
Ha.

293
00:18:35,934 --> 00:18:38,846
Rahmat.

294
00:18:38,869 --> 00:18:43,373
Kartangiz va chekni qaytarib beraman.

295
00:18:43,397 --> 00:18:46,332
Rahmat.

296
00:18:46,356 --> 00:18:51,889
Keyingi safar bir oy o‘tgach kelishingiz ma‘qul.

297
00:18:51,912 --> 00:18:54,613
Tushunarli.

298
00:18:54,637 --> 00:18:57,273
Yana kelaman.

299
00:18:57,296 --> 00:19:00,363
Katta rahmat.

300
00:19:00,386 --> 00:19:03,252
Yo‘lga ehtiyot bo‘ling.

301
00:19:03,275 --> 00:19:06,209
Xayr.